- **[38;5;10mengine.c[0m opcode 9 pops twice.** The [38;5;10miv_pop[0m loop is duplicated, draining up to [38;5;10m2m[0m values. Since [38;5;10miv_pop[0m leaves [38;5;10m*out[0m untouched on failure, [38;5;10mtmp[i][0m retains the first loop's value when the stack runs dry — reproduced via [38;5;10mif let Some(v) = ... { tmp[i] = v }[0m.[0m[0m
- **[38;5;10mvm_print[0m uses [38;5;10m& 25[0m, not [38;5;10m% 26[0m.** Trace codes 0 and 2 both render as [38;5;10ma[0m (hence [38;5;10mTRACE=aaaai[0m above).[0m[0m
